rror_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5159800-1847286114041758","game_id":"steam-5159800","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.5.1: new controls, corrupted objects and more","summary":"An update built on your bug reports and playtests. Thank you for sending them, the Report a bug button in the pause menu brings them straight to us. New controls Left click acts on the world: doors, drawers, picking up, switches, talking, computers, the claim form's paper and the tablet's buttons. E uses what you hold, and also leaves a computer, a conversation, the notepad or the mission menu, so a click inside a screen never closes it. Right click is only for zooming and aiming the camera. The","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:43:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041758","verified_at":"2026-10-25T12:14:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5159800-1847286114037804","game_id":"steam-5159800","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.5.0: a training room, a new interview and five languages","summary":"Your first days on the demo taught us one thing: the job is hard to learn under fire. So the company built a training room. This update also rebuilds the interview, calms the haunting down, and brings the game to five new languages. Now in five new languagesChoose yours in Settings > Game.Français : le jeu est maintenant disponible en français. Italiano: il gioco è ora disponibile in italiano. Español: el juego ya está disponible en español. Português: o jogo já está disponível em português (Por","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T19:44:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037804","verified_at":"2026-10-23T21:46:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5159800-1846651706690622","game_id":"steam-5159800","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.4.0: madness, a smarter hunter, and two weeks of playtests","summary":"The demo has changed a lot since it first went up. Two weeks of playtests, your reports and a lot of late nights later, here is everything that is new. Thank you for being here for the Next Fest. Madness You can see it coming: from half sanity, the picture darkens, loses its colours, and its edges wobble and trail, with a heartbeat that quickens as you slip. Whispers only you can hear join in on the edge of madness. Muffled hearing: the world, and your teammates' voices, fade away. Once mad, not","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:57:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690622","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:32:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5159800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:34:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T23:34:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5159800":"2026-10-25T23:34:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5159800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:34:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:34:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5392830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:34:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:34:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5159800","app_id":5159800,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"5394b9821e54ce1d6adfe7cdba3c05b7ed412480d8ea442a1ceb787163eb7f22","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":